-- title:
--   Original BV infinite-activity strictly stopped cash and terminal expected reward is monotone
-- statement:
--   For each original BV source, genuine singular dividend strategy, fixed positive horizon T, and strict stopping indices n<=m, the expected discounted inner-horizon Stieltjes dividend cash plus the identical surviving full-T postpayment reward increases with index. This follows from original pathwise monotonicity and both exact source payoff L1 results, and provides a reusable bridge to obtain all fixed-horizon expectations from cofinal signed-grid budget estimates.
-- source:
--   Direct corollary of Proved bva33 payoff integrability and Proved bva35 original pathwise monotonicity.

import Mathlib
